From 65b40e69acbcb28c0e7ef9228f731c444a788e93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Justin M. Keyes" <justinkz@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Apr 2026 05:38:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(lua): not obvious which _meta/ files are generated #39035

Problem:
- Not obvious which _meta/ are generated and which should be edited
  manually.
- The require guard (`error('Cannot require a meta file')`) is not
  consistently present in all meta files.

Solution:
- Update headers.
- Add require() guard to all meta files.
- Rename generated meta files with `.gen.lua`.
